WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.051 --> 00:00:00.671
- Where's your hand?

00:00:00.671 --> 00:00:01.571
- I wish I could high five you.

00:00:01.571 --> 00:00:02.690
Wait can you?

00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:04.531
OK, wait, do it again.

00:00:04.531 --> 00:00:06.360
- Yay.

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:10.650
(lighthearted music)

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:11.574
- I love nuggets

00:00:11.574 --> 00:00:14.234
- Chicken nuggets, are
like a passion for sure.

00:00:14.234 --> 00:00:16.534
- Whenever I'm super drunk
and I go to McDonald's

00:00:16.534 --> 00:00:19.734
I get like 20 chicken nuggets
and I eat most of them.

00:00:19.734 --> 00:00:22.074
- A good nugget has to have a good

00:00:22.074 --> 00:00:23.794
breading to nugget ratio.

00:00:23.794 --> 00:00:26.394
- Crispy on the outside,
but tender on the inside.

00:00:28.964 --> 00:00:31.948
- This is 100% McDonald's, I
can just tell by the shape.

00:00:33.158 --> 00:00:34.121
- Oh, juicy.

00:00:34.121 --> 00:00:35.262
- Oh, this is from Burger King.

00:00:35.262 --> 00:00:36.702
- It's a little bland.

00:00:36.702 --> 00:00:38.322
- This is from Wendy's.

00:00:40.992 --> 00:00:41.693
- How crunchy,

00:00:41.693 --> 00:00:43.693
this is a sculpture of sorts.

00:00:43.693 --> 00:00:45.113
- Oh, what is this?

00:00:45.113 --> 00:00:47.093
- Oh, OK, interesting shape.

00:00:47.093 --> 00:00:49.013
- You could chip a tooth on this thing.

00:00:49.013 --> 00:00:49.873
- Meaty.

00:00:49.873 --> 00:00:51.213
- I feel like it smells like Popeyes.

00:00:51.213 --> 00:00:52.313
So, I'm into it.

00:00:54.683 --> 00:00:56.131
- This is a husky little nugget.

00:00:56.131 --> 00:00:59.171
- Man, why is it so, like, soft?

00:01:00.051 --> 00:01:02.381
- This one's gross.
(laughs)

00:01:02.381 --> 00:01:04.615
- It doesn't really
taste really flavorful.

00:01:04.615 --> 00:01:07.609
- Maybe it's like, like a 7-Eleven.

00:01:10.169 --> 00:01:11.873
- This is McDonald's, I can tell.

00:01:11.873 --> 00:01:12.966
- (laughs) You said this before.

00:01:12.966 --> 00:01:13.626
- I know.

00:01:13.626 --> 00:01:16.226
- You can tell 'cause
it tastes like rubber.

00:01:16.226 --> 00:01:18.646
- It's like too moist,
it's like too moist.

00:01:18.646 --> 00:01:20.146
Like, you're like, how is it so moist?

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:22.226
- That is a good nugget.

00:01:22.226 --> 00:01:23.246
- It's McDonald's.

00:01:23.246 --> 00:01:25.066
- Yeah, this is Ronald, definitely

00:01:25.066 --> 00:01:25.984
my man Ronald, shout out.

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:30.186
- The chicken places know how to make

00:01:30.186 --> 00:01:32.406
chicken nuggets better
than the burger places.

00:01:32.406 --> 00:01:34.686
- The 7-Eleven one was
actually pretty good.

00:01:34.686 --> 00:01:37.166
- Like the meat tasted, like, OK.

00:01:37.166 --> 00:01:39.126
- 7-Eleven was definitely
the worst nugget.

00:01:39.126 --> 00:01:40.006
The worst one.

00:01:40.006 --> 00:01:43.606
It just, it was shaped weirdly,
it looked like Play-Doh,

00:01:43.606 --> 00:01:45.166
that was just coming apart.

00:01:45.166 --> 00:01:47.486
- I'm still a McDonald's or Wendy's guy.

